<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As we reflect on the fiscal year 2023-24, we are filled with pride and gratitude for the achievements and progress MISSION has made. This year has been a testament to the power of collaboration, resilience, and unwavering commitment to our mission.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Over the past year, we have successfully launched 15 new programs and expanded our reach to more communities in need. Our initiatives impacted over 3,265 families/ individuals, providing essential services and support. We also hosted events that brought together stakeholders from various sectors to discuss and advance our shared goals.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Looking ahead, we are excited to build on our successes and address new challenges. Our focus will be on scaling our programs, enhancing our advocacy efforts, and strengthening our partnerships. We are committed to deepening our impact and ensuring that our work continues to bring about meaningful change in the lives of those we serve.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (None of our achievements would have been possible without the dedication of our staff, volunteers, and partners. We are immensely grateful for the generous support of our donors, whose contributions have fueled our mission. To our beneficiaries, your courage and perseverance inspire us every day. Together, we will continue to drive forward with hope and determination.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Thank you for being a part of the MISSION journey.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
