165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (MISSION NGO, founded in 2002 with the goal of addressing acute poverty and social injustice, has grown from a small grassroots organization into a leading advocate for the poor in Odisha. Our priorities include reducing poverty, ensuring social justice, and promoting good governance and citizens' rights. We engage communities in development initiatives, addressing basic needs like health, education, and sanitation, while also tackling socio-economic issues. Our innovative programs and dedicated efforts have impacted thousands of lives.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
