167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our mission is to mitigate acute poverty and starvation, ensure social inclusion and justice, promote good governance, and uphold citizens' rights, striving to create a world where to create a just, equitable society where all individuals, regardless of their background, have the opportunity to thrive and contribute to their communities.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
