247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Under the Grassroot Training Programme for SHGs, 261 members have undergone extensive training to enhance their financial and business skills. This initiative included four comprehensive training sessions where SHG members were taught crucial skills such as bookkeeping, fund management, and business management. These sessions aimed to empower the members to manage their finances effectively, sustain their businesses, and contribute to the economic development of their communities.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
