351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Partnerships and collaborations have been pivotal in MISSION journey, enriching our program delivery and amplifying our impact. We have developed strong relationships with key organizations like NABARD, KVIC, MSME, and DIC Odisha, combining resources and expertise to effectively reach more communities.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Through collaborative projects such as LEDP, ESDP, FPO, and EDP, we have tackled issues like unemployment, livelihood and achieved tangible outcomes, underscoring the effectiveness of our partnerships. These initiatives have broadened our reach and deepened the impact of our programs.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The significance of these partnerships cannot be overstated. They have provided invaluable resources, knowledge, and support, significantly enhancing our efforts and accelerating progress towards our goals. Through these collaborations, we have accessed additional funding, expert guidance, and technical assistance, which have collectively boosted our operational capacity by 30%.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our partnership with NABARD has enabled us to train over 500 individuals under various programs, while our collaboration with KVIC has facilitated the distribution of 100 potter's wheels, directly benefiting 60 artisans. Similarly, our joint efforts with MSME have led to the establishment of 10-15 new small-scale enterprises, creating employment opportunities for 200 community members. The support from DIC Odisha has been instrumental in reaching an additional 20 villages, extending our impact to over 10,000 people.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
