364 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Volunteers and staff are the backbone of MISSION, crucial to the success of our programs. Our volunteers have contributed over 1680 hours in training and mentoring, conducting workshops and community outreach efforts that have reached over 1480 individuals. They have been key in implementing projects like LEDP and ESDP, helping train over 1,000 individuals in various skills.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
365 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We also invest significantly in our staff's professional development, with over 14 staff members receiving specialized training in project management, financial literacy, and community development. Our collaborative team approach has led to the successful completion and benefiting over 10,000 people. Staff members' direct field engagement has strengthened our programs, making them more responsive and effective.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The collective efforts of our volunteers and staff have led to a 40% increase in beneficiaries and a 25% improvement in project outcomes. Moving forward, we plan to expand our volunteer network by 50% and introduce new staff training programs to meet evolving community needs. Moving forward, we aim to expand our volunteer network by 50% and introduce new staff training programs to better meet community needs, ensuring we continue to make a meaningful difference.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
