/P 726 0 R
/ActualText (Achieving high levels of community participation and ownership has been difficult, particularly in areas with low literacy rates or deep-seated traditional beliefs.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 727 0 R
/ActualText (Ensuring the long-term sustainability of our projects after the initial funding and support phase has been challenging, particularly in economically disadvantaged communities.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
375 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 728 0 R
/ActualText (Securing consistent and sufficient funding has been a persistent challenge. Limited financial resources often restrict the scale and scope of our programs.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
