377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 729 0 R
/ActualText (Effective community engagement requires tailored, context-specific strategies. We have found success by involving community leaders in the planning process, using local languages, and incorporating culturally relevant practices.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 730 0 R
/ActualText (To overcome logistical challenges, investing in local capacity building has been crucial. Training local volunteers and staff reduces dependency on external resources and ensures better adaptability to local conditions.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
